// Malicious PowerShell Commandlets - ScriptBlock | T1059.001, T1069, T1069.001, T1069.002, T1087, T1087.001, T1087.002, T1482 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/powershell/powershell_script/posh_ps_malicious_commandlets.yml
